ACKNOWLEDGMENTS

This project is an independent reimplementation inspired by, and partially
derived from, ALVR (https://github.com/alvr-org/ALVR):

    Copyright (c) 2018-2019 polygraphene
    Copyright (c) 2020-2024 alvr-org
    Licensed under the MIT License.

In particular, the OpenXR face/eye tracking extension handling and the
VRCFT sink wire format are based on ALVR's client and server code.

This project interoperates with the VRCFT-ALVR module for VRCFaceTracking
(https://github.com/alvr-org/VRCFT-ALVR), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. No code from VRCFT-ALVR is included in this project; only its
network protocol is implemented for compatibility.
